    <item>
      <title>The Loremaster</title>
      <link>https://darkestnotes.org/posts/the-loremaster/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://darkestnotes.org/posts/the-loremaster/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://darkestnotes.org/posts/the-loremaster/images/Loremaster-1.gif&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bug dolu quest&amp;rsquo;ler, çalışmayan script&amp;rsquo;ler, işe yaramayan çöp quest gear&amp;rsquo;ı, 2005 yılından beri kıyıda köşede kalmış unutulmuş hikayeler&amp;hellip;Ve sonunda &lt;strong&gt;World of Warcraft&lt;/strong&gt; -The Loremaster- achievement&amp;rsquo;ı&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I am the bone of loremaster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Quest book is my body, and lore is my blood.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;I have completed over a thousand quests.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Unknown to death.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Nor known to life.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Have withstood pain to complete so many quests.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Yet, those hands will never achieve anything.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;So as I pray, &amp;ldquo;Unlimited Quest Works.&amp;rdquo; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7520/the-loremaster#comments&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
